{"mode":"words","text":"Jei mokaisi žodžių sąrašus, tu nemoki kalbos. Šiame puslapyje gali gyvai pamatyti, kaip per kelias sekundes viskas pasikeičia: Pateiktas pavyzdinis tekstas yra tikrasis programėlės vaizdas, kurį gali išbandyti pats, o šį paaiškinimą tau tuoj pat perskaitys gimtakalbio kokybės balsas, tuo tarpu žodžiai bus paryškinti. Su „LinguaFlow“ mokaisi kalbų taip, kaip tai patinka tavo smegenims: pirmiausia suprasti, tada išgirsti, tada ištarti. Šis metodas yra įkvėptas Birkenbihl metodo ir susideda iš keturių etapų: dekodavimas, aktyvus klausymas, pasyvus klausymas ir praktikavimas. Išbandyk – spustelėk žodį viršuje.","words":[{"s":0,"e":160},{"s":200,"e":640},{"s":720,"e":1080},{"s":1120,"e":1640},{"s":1680,"e":1760},{"s":1800,"e":2160},{"s":2220,"e":2800},{"s":3440,"e":4240},{"s":4280,"e":4720},{"s":4800,"e":4960},{"s":5013,"e":5280},{"s":5320,"e":5840},{"s":5867,"e":6000},{"s":6020,"e":6080},{"s":6140,"e":6400},{"s":6440,"e":6880},{"s":6920,"e":7200},{"s":7260,"e":8480},{"s":8520,"e":8880},{"s":8920,"e":9520},{"s":9573,"e":10000},{"s":10040,"e":10160},{"s":10220,"e":10720},{"s":10760,"e":11467},{"s":11484,"e":12240},{"s":12280,"e":12533},{"s":12560,"e":12640},{"s":12680,"e":13280},{"s":13320,"e":14080},{"s":14120,"e":14160},{"s":14200,"e":14400},{"s":14427,"e":14960},{"s":15000,"e":15120},{"s":15147,"e":15280},{"s":15340,"e":15520},{"s":15568,"e":16080},{"s":16120,"e":16640},{"s":16680,"e":17120},{"s":17200,"e":18000},{"s":18040,"e":18160},{"s":18200,"e":18480},{"s":18520,"e":18880},{"s":18920,"e":19040},{"s":19120,"e":19920},{"s":20533,"e":21760},{"s":21800,"e":22680},{"s":22720,"e":23120},{"s":23240,"e":23441},{"s":23442,"e":23761},{"s":23801,"e":23961},{"s":24001,"e":24161},{"s":24241,"e":24641},{"s":24721,"e":24961},{"s":25014,"e":26161},{"s":26201,"e":26641},{"s":26701,"e":27441},{"s":27601,"e":27921},{"s":28001,"e":29041},{"s":29081,"e":29361},{"s":29481,"e":30241},{"s":31081,"e":32001},{"s":32054,"e":32481},{"s":32521,"e":32641},{"s":32801,"e"